---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = '2024-12-10';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for KNR Collective."
  noindex={false}
>
  <div class="legal-page">
    <div class="section-container">
      <nav class="page-nav">
        <a href="/" class="back-link">← KNR/</a>
      </nav>

      <header class="page-header">
        <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="page-meta">Last updated: <time datetime={lastUpdated}>December 10, 2024</time></p>
      </header>

      <div class="legal-body">
        <section>
          <h2>Overview</h2>
          <p>
            KNR Collective respects your privacy. This policy explains what information we collect,
            how we use it, and your rights regarding that information. We collect only what's
            necessary to provide our services and improve your experience.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Information we collect</h2>
          <h3>Contact forms</h3>
          <p>
            When you submit a project inquiry through our contact form, we collect your name,
            email address, project type, and message content. This information is used solely
            to respond to your inquiry and discuss potential collaboration.
          </p>
          <h3>Website analytics</h3>
          <p>
            We may use privacy-focused analytics to understand how visitors use our website.
            This includes general information like pages visited, time spent on site, and
            referral sources. No personally identifiable information is collected through analytics.
          </p>
          <h3>Server logs</h3>
          <p>
            Our web servers automatically log standard information including IP addresses,
            browser types, and page requests for security and troubleshooting purposes.
            These logs are retained for a limited time and not used for tracking.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>How we use your information</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Respond to project inquiries and communicate about potential work</li>
            <li>Provide updates on project progress for active clients</li>
            <li>Improve our website and services based on usage patterns</li>
            <li>Ensure website security and prevent abuse</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties
            for marketing purposes. We do not send unsolicited promotional emails.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Data storage and security</h2>
          <p>
            Your information is stored securely using industry-standard practices.
            Contact form submissions are transmitted over encrypted connections and
            stored on secure servers. We implement appropriate technical and organizational
            measures to protect against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Client work confidentiality</h2>
          <p>
            For active projects, all client information, code, business details, and
            project specifics are treated with strict confidentiality. We sign NDAs
            when requested and maintain professional confidentiality standards regardless.
            Client information is never shared without explicit written consent.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Third-party services</h2>
          <p>
            Our contact form may use third-party services (such as Formspree) to process
            submissions. These services have their own privacy policies and security measures.
            We choose services that prioritize privacy and data protection.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
          <p>
            This website uses minimal cookies, primarily for essential functionality.
            We do not use tracking cookies or third-party advertising networks.
            Any analytics cookies used are privacy-focused and do not collect personal information.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Your rights</h2>
          <p>
            You have the right to request information about data we hold about you,
            request corrections to inaccurate information, or request deletion of your data.
            For contact form submissions, you can request removal at any time.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Data retention</h2>
          <p>
            Contact form submissions are retained for up to 2 years to allow for follow-up
            on potential projects. Server logs are retained for 90 days. Client project data
            is retained as specified in individual project agreements.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this privacy policy to reflect changes in our practices or
            for legal reasons. Updated policies will be posted on this page with
            a new "last updated" date.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Questions about this privacy policy or our data practices:
            <a href="mailto:knrcollective@proton.me">knrcollective@proton.me</a>
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding-top: calc(56px + var(--space-16));
    padding-bottom: var(--space-24);
    min-height: 100svh;
    background: #000;
  }
  .page-nav { margin-bottom: var(--space-10); }
  .back-link {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: #ffffff; /* Improved contrast from #cccccc */
    opacity: 0.9; /* Subtle distinction while maintaining contrast */
    transition: color var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-out);
  }
  .back-link:hover { color: #ffffff; }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-8);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }
  .page-title { 
    font-size: var(--text-xl); 
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .page-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: #ffffff; /* Improved contrast from #cccccc */
    opacity: 0.9; /* Subtle distinction while maintaining contrast */
    max-width: none;
  }

  .legal-body {
    max-width: 680px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-10);
  }

  .legal-body section { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-3); }

  .legal-body h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .legal-body h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .legal-body p {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: #ffffff; /* Improved contrast from #eeeeee */
    opacity: 0.9; /* Subtle distinction while maintaining contrast */
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 68ch;
  }

  .legal-body ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .legal-body li {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: #ffffff; /* Improved contrast from #eeeeee */
    opacity: 0.9; /* Subtle distinction while maintaining contrast */
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding-left: var(--space-4);
    position: relative;
  }

  .legal-body li::before {
    content: '•';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .legal-body a {
    color: #ffffff;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: #ffffff; /* Improved contrast from #cccccc */
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    transition: text-decoration-color var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-out);
  }
  .legal-body a:hover { text-decoration-color: #ffffff; }
</style>
